---
import Layout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Pricing from '../components/Pricing.astro';
import { pointPlans, pricingFaqs } from '../data/pricing';
---
<Layout title="译想价格方案" description="简单透明，总有一款适合你。译想基础版49元/月、专业版75元/月、高级版99元/月，支持积分套餐，免费版注册即送3万积分。">
  <section class="container page-hero">
    <h1>译想价格方案</h1>
    <p>简单透明，总有一款适合你。免费版注册即送 3 万积分，先试用再决定。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft compact" id="monthly">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <h2>包月套餐</h2>
        <p>每天都要聊客户？包月套餐更划算，不限字符，畅聊全球</p>
      </div>
      <Pricing />
      <p class="center purchase-note">下载译想，在软件内直接扫码购买。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" id="points">
    <div class="section-heading center">
      <h2>积分套餐</h2>
      <p>使用频率不固定？积分套餐更灵活，用多少扣多少，不浪费</p>
    </div>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>翻译引擎</th><th>价格</th><th>适合场景</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{pointPlans.map(([engine, price, scenario]) => <tr><td>{engine}</td><td>¥{price} / 100万字符</td><td>{scenario}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="center purchase-note">
      <p>使用时先充值购买积分，使用不同翻译引擎消耗的积分不同。</p>
      <p>下载译想，在软件内直接扫码购买。</p>
      <a class="button" href="/download/">下载软件购买</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading center"><h2>不知道选哪个？</h2></div>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <article><h3>每天都要聊客户</h3><p>包月套餐更划算，不限字符</p></article>
        <article><h3>偶尔用一下</h3><p>积分套餐更灵活，用多少扣多少</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container prose narrow">
    <h2>常见问题</h2>
    {pricingFaqs.map(([question, answer], index) => <details open><summary>{index + 1}. {question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .purchase-note { margin-top: 24px; }
  .purchase-note .button { margin-top: 24px; }
  .choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; text-align: center; }
  .choice-grid article { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; }
  .choice-grid p { margin-top: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .choice-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
